    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556658d39262751d57abd8a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来，我要夺得秋之冠！\n一定会把它握在手中！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c612a9e0eb3686aef7238e41612356a78b018d97f6fc719f5f35e94349152a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd614d7f39aace141fe7aaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一次又一次，一次又一次，回想起今天见到\n的景象……她展现出的奔跑，那份强大。\n实在太过震撼――",
      "source_fingerprint": "df492e33ccce75250a4220949e115c60514ab7695e9e0ae17ad6c308e13c8e13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3677c7e275a3bce8df02833",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是，啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c25092b76b653a04c2d36c36e8fd9323f8fe0095e2d86157a8c450132ccc0e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
