    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a971dfee1881899b7db265b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是，压倒性的表现。\n……莱茵同学的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ba17e335c3f4d208d5b22cf8a13cb346529128f33eebef7316559ca6ea056c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02bb4a7fb59c6012104c845",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，我还是勉强……\n启动电脑，动作迟缓地，\n打开了一如往常的云端共享文件夹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "396603e83ca47f394375b03e06c451412b2292853d6c67dcb94b8817feb28e96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f79515cf4748adab4b3265f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量已经表明将参加『秋华赏』。\n也就是说，我们必须继续研究对策。\n……『对手数据分析_37』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d494a462524723b77cca89c78ff66a251c9a3bfe9194a329b12f0898474d0c4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1cc409109be5ca651e43fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对『樱花赏』后才刚调整过的，\n莱茵力量数据进一步修改。\n上调。――再次上调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49df0a4b41416a1f13f279ccda118c249906c9561a9f37f087284f583eab55b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
